# Ask the people around the robot for help, as a question they answer with yes or no:
# to put an item on the tray or take it off, or whether to try a failed step again.
# Served by the HRI module, which says the question and hears the answer.

std_skills/Meta meta

# Why the robot asks.
string LOAD_TRAY = load_tray
string UNLOAD_TRAY = unload_tray
string STEP_FAILED = step_failed
string problem

# What the robot says, ending in the question: "Please put the insulin on my tray. Is it
# on the tray now?"
string text

# The ID of the person to ask; if empty, whoever is there.
string person_id

---

# ROS_ENOERR once someone answered, ROS_EOTHER when nobody did.
std_skills/Result result

# Whether the answer was yes.
bool yes

---

std_skills/Feedback feedback
